<title>JORDAN: Jordan says checking reported shooting.</title>
<headline>Jordan says checking reported shooting.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan is investigating reports that a gunman opened fire across its border into Israel on Thursday, an official said.</p>
<p>&quot;We sent a military investigation team to the site to see what has happened,&quot; the official said. Israel Radio said two people were killed and many had been injured in the shooting.</p>
</text>
